<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Belfox to launch medium-term bond future.</title>
<headline>Belgian Belfox to launch medium-term bond future.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian futures and options exchange Belfox said on Wednesday that it planned to launch a futures contract on medium-term government bonds on May 16.</p>
</text>
